    "title": "Joint Base McGuire-Dix-Lakehurst clear after emergency security alert",
    "text": "EMERGENCIESJoint Base McGuire-Dix-Lakehurst all clear after emergency security alert Erik LarsenAsbury Park PressUpdated March 17, 2026, 5:36 p.m. ETJOINT BASE MCGUIRE-DIX-LAKEHURST ― Security forces have issued an “all clear” Tuesday afternoon after a report of suspicious packages triggered a brief but intense elevated terrorist alert across the sprawling military installation.The high-security incident, which began mid-afternoon, forced the base to jump to FPCON CHARLIE — a security posture indicating that an incident is occurring or that intelligence suggests a terrorist action against personnel or facilities is likely.",
